item TIDE_COMPASS NAVIGATION - INSPECT Tide Compass
detail TIDE_COMPASS A brass compass marked with the seven realm docks. Salt has polished its rim silver.
item DOCK_CHART NAVIGATION - INSPECT Dock Chart
detail DOCK_CHART A chart of boat landings and submarine airlocks, annotated by generations of ferry crews.
item SONAR_LOG NAVIGATION - INSPECT Sonar Log
detail SONAR_LOG A waterproof notebook filled with depth marks and the outlines of old wrecks.
item DIVE_MASK DIVING - INSPECT Dive Mask
detail DIVE_MASK A saltglass mask with a soft seal and tiny shells caught in its strap.
item AIR_CANISTER DIVING - INSPECT Air Canister
detail AIR_CANISTER A blue canister stamped with the harbor diver's crest. Its valve is tightly sealed.
item DIVE_LANTERN DIVING - INSPECT Dive Lantern
detail DIVE_LANTERN A sealed lamp from the airlock keeper, with a pearl-white lens and a folding handle.
item SALVAGE_CLAW SALVAGE - INSPECT Salvage Claw
detail SALVAGE_CLAW A long retrieval claw with padded jaws, made to lift treasure without breaking coral.
item SEA_GLASS SALVAGE - INSPECT Sea Glass
detail SEA_GLASS Green and lavender glass rounded smooth by the tide. Dock artisans prize its cloudy glow.
item WRECK_PLATE SALVAGE - INSPECT Wreck Plate
detail WRECK_PLATE A recovered hull plate bearing half a ship's name and three stubborn barnacles.
item HULL_PATCH VESSEL - INSPECT Hull Patch
detail HULL_PATCH A waxed packet of resin cloth and copper fasteners from the shipwright's bench.
item MOORING_LINE VESSEL - INSPECT Mooring Line
detail MOORING_LINE A neatly coiled line with a red thread woven through it, the ferryman's mark.
item BEACON_LENS QUESTS - INSPECT Beacon Lens
detail BEACON_LENS A many-faceted lens from the harbor beacon. A crack runs through its golden centre.
item SEALED_COURIER_CASE QUESTS - INSPECT Sealed Courier Case
detail SEALED_COURIER_CASE A waterproof delivery case addressed to the far dock. The seal bears a tiny rainbow.
